WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.950
Talk Together. Sit down with everyone at home, including children and older family members.

00:00:05.000 --> 00:00:09.950
Pick Meeting Points. Choose one spot near home and one outside your neighbourhood.

00:00:10.000 --> 00:00:14.950
List Contacts. Write down family, barangay and emergency numbers on paper as a backup.

00:00:15.000 --> 00:00:19.950
Learn The Routes. Walk the route to your evacuation centre together and note any barriers.

00:00:20.000 --> 00:00:24.950
Practice Twice A Year. Rehearse your plan and update it when your household changes.

